= Dev Console

- @budget: Manage the Party's budget
- @root: Cancel

@budget

- @res: Add a bunch of resources
- @bud: Add a bunch of budget
- @addg: Add one grassroots
- @removeg: Remove one grassroots
- @addb: Add one backing
- @removeb: Remove one backing
- @adde: Add one expense
- @removee: Remove one expense
- @partybudget: Go back
- @root: Cancel

@res
on-arrival: resources += 999

Ok.

- @partybudget: Continue...

@bud
on-arrival: budget += 999

Ok.

- @partybudget: Continue...

@addg
on-arrival: grassroots += 1

Ok.

- @partybudget: Continue...

@removeg
on-arrival: grassroots -= 1

Ok.

- @partybudget: Continue...

@addb
on-arrival: backing += 1

Ok.

- @partybudget: Continue...

@removeb
on-arrival: backing -= 1

Ok.

- @partybudget: Continue...

@adde
on-arrival: expense += 1

Ok.

- @partybudget: Continue...

@removee
on-arrival: expense -= 1

Ok.

- @partybudget: Continue...
